#tutor01
#tutor02
                            Military Academy of Kazan
                            10th of September
Dear &

Congratulations on your results. During your training you
have collected nearly all the awards you could possibly get,
you have finished first in all subjects, physical and intellectual,
and as team captain of the Kazan Dragons, you brought
back the Officer Academy Tournament Trophy three times.

As one would expect, they have heard about you at the
Headquarters and I have been instructed to transmit
your orders to you.
Well it wasn't long coming ! You will be in charge of the
base of Lanion on the south front.

It's a test, they want to evaluate your skills as a colony
resources manager.
Be careful, communists are trying to settle in this zone.
You must be ready to prevent your installations from the
enemy attacks.
Patrol the area to find and eliminate enemy presence.

The local team of scientists should help you to establish a
light tanks production facilities without delay.

The school reputation now lies in your hands,
You have my complete confidence, good luck.


                            Major Georges Bart.